<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSSx2" title="In 4.3 Error Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ GBV-SQL: Guided Generation and SQL2Text Back-Translation Validation for Multi-Agent Text2SQL" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">A New Typology of Gold Errors</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSSx3" title="In 4.3 Error Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ GBV-SQL: Guided Generation and SQL2Text Back-Translation Validation for Multi-Agent Text2SQL" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Analysis of Gold Errors in Spider</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
